Section 91/21 The following provisions in Chapter 4 shall apply mutatis mutandis:
(1) part 7, Filing of Returns and Payment of Tax, sections 83/2 and 83/3;
(2) part 8, Tax Credit and Refund of Value Added Tax, section 84/3;
(3) part 9, Value Added Tax Registration, sections 85/4, 85/5, 85/6, 85/7, 85/8, 85/9, 85/12, 85/13, 85/14, 85/15, 85/16, 85/17, 85/18 and 85/19; 16
16N.DG.SBT.No.2.
(4) part11, Preparation of Records and Maintenance of Documents, section 87/3;
(5) part 12, Power of Assessment Official, sections 88/3, 88/4 and 88/5;
(6) part 13, Penalties and Surcharges, all sections;
(7) part14, Punishment, in connection with the provisions of the sections listed above including section 90/5.
Section 91 Specific business tax is an assessment tax.
